# Every image builds from the repository root (see each Dockerfile), so this file
# keeps the context small and keeps secrets and local data out of it. Dockerfiles
# COPY explicit paths, so nothing below is ever needed inside an image.

# Version control and agent tooling
.git
.github
.claude

# Secrets: no .env file ever enters a build context (SECURITY A1)
.env*

# Local data and key material (SECURITY A16)
data
backups
**/*.dump
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12

# Dependencies and build output: images install and build their own
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.vite
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.log
